# What semgrep does not scan in the CI security gate (IR-614).
#
# This file exists to *replace* semgrep's built-in ignore list, which also
# skips every `test/` and `tests/` directory -- 277 tracked files here, silently
# and for every rule. Tests stay in scope: a real secret or an injection
# pattern in a test file is still one. Only generated, vendored or installed
# code is left out below, none of which is ours to fix.

:include .gitignore

.git/
node_modules/
build/
dist/
vendor/
.venv/
venv/
*.min.js
